    "slug": "how-does-the-best-cardiologist-in-delhi-differentiate-complex-coronary-disease-from-less-severe-cardiac-conditions",
    "title": "How Does the Best Cardiologist in Delhi Differentiate Complex Coronary Disease From Less Severe Cardiac Conditions",
    "category": "Cardiology",
